# A turtle, walking. Front, back and side; the left side is the right one mirrored.
pxart 1

o #1b2a1c
# shell: light to dark
L #a8e07a
G #6fbf4a
g #3f8a34
d #275e26
# skin
S #f0d27a
s #c49a48
k #7a5a2c
w #ffffff
e #121212
p #f09a8a

